<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch post Dfl 3.6 billion December trade surplus.</title>
<headline>Dutch post Dfl 3.6 billion December trade surplus.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch trade surplus widened to a provisional 3.6 billion guilders in December 1996 from 2.9 billion in the previous month, the Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
